133
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,940
Tim, I couldn't agree with you more.

134
00:08:50,140 --> 00:08:51,940
Lead, inspire, and train.

135
00:08:52,300 --> 00:08:58,420
Also, on our last podcast, Podcast 39, we talked a little bit about courts of honor and

136
00:08:58,420 --> 00:08:59,500
