692
00:50:13,560 --> 00:50:16,720
That was the best thing we've ever done in scouting.

693
00:50:17,280 --> 00:50:22,340
Those moments are just exhilarating.

694
00:50:22,620 --> 00:50:28,660
You just feel on the top of the world that you've made a difference.

695
00:50:29,400 --> 00:50:30,600
So, Harry, you're up.

696
00:50:30,820 --> 00:50:32,060
What's your best scouting moment?

697
00:50:32,360 --> 00:50:41,620
Actually happened last year when I was able to, I was a crew advisor for a crew that went to Philmont.

698
00:50:41,620 --> 00:50:51,680
And finally, towards the end, the crew came together as one.

699
00:50:51,680 --> 00:50:55,379
And they really got it.

700
00:50:55,879 --> 00:51:06,799
And on the bus ride, when they presented me with a belt buckle, I finally realized that they finally got it and what it really meant.

701
00:51:07,120 --> 00:51:09,879
That was probably one of my greatest scouting moments.

